            "caseStudyName": "AI in the Middle: Web-Based AI Services as C2 Relays",
            "description": "The victim's collected host information was exfiltrated when the AI service followed the instructions to fetch the URL to the adversary-controlled domain with the data embedded in a query parameter.",
            "url": "https://atlas.mitre.org/studies/AML.CS0061",
