        "caseStudyName": "Living Off AI: Prompt Injection via Jira Service Management",
        "description": "The researchers performed reconnaissance to learn about Atlassian's Model Context Protocol (MCP) server and its integration into the Jira Service Management (JSM) platform. Atlassian offers an MCP server, which embeds AI into enterprise workflows. Their MCP enables a range of AI-driven actions, such as ticket summarization, auto-replies, classification, and smart recommendations across JSM and Confluence. It allows support engineers and internal users to interact with AI directly from their native interfaces.",
        "url": "https://atlas.mitre.org/studies/AML.CS0039",
